  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DID # 89171 USD 1089500.00 from KOICA PIMS 9487 - DSA Kyrgyzstan project. KOICA has requested UNDP to host a knowledge sharing workshop on its approach to GCF programming, and provide support on the design and development of one GCF Concept Note and one GCF FP, including standard annexes.</narrative>
